WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.312 --> 00:00:02.645
(swooshing)

00:00:15.964 --> 00:00:19.037
- [Narrator] Getting word of mouth.

00:00:19.037 --> 00:00:21.041
"If you do build a great experience

00:00:21.041 --> 00:00:23.452
"customers tell each other about that.

00:00:23.452 --> 00:00:25.895
"Word of mouth is very powerful."

00:00:25.895 --> 00:00:30.699
Jeff Bezos, billionaire
co-founder of Amazon.com.

00:00:30.699 --> 00:00:33.548
If you don't get powerful
word of mouth, you're sunk.

00:00:33.548 --> 00:00:35.088
You don't have the big budgets to take out

00:00:35.088 --> 00:00:38.224
a Super Bowl commercial or
hire a celebrity spokesperson.

00:00:38.224 --> 00:00:40.838
You need people talking about you.

00:00:40.838 --> 00:00:43.440
Having a great product
or service isn't enough.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.607
You need to make it easy for
people to talk about you.

00:00:48.582 --> 00:00:51.238
Think about how busy your customers are.

00:00:51.238 --> 00:00:53.072
They have opportunities every single day

00:00:53.072 --> 00:00:55.515
to promote you to their
colleagues and friends.

00:00:55.515 --> 00:00:56.932
Every single day.

00:00:57.926 --> 00:01:00.091
And they don't, why?

00:01:00.091 --> 00:01:02.619
It's not because they don't
love your product or service.

00:01:02.619 --> 00:01:04.330
If they don't, then
you need to get to work

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.994
on improving your offering.

00:01:05.994 --> 00:01:08.564
It's because you don't standout enough.

00:01:08.564 --> 00:01:12.436
They forget about you, you're just okay.

00:01:12.436 --> 00:01:14.644
But when you stand for
something important,

00:01:14.644 --> 00:01:16.596
something people feel connected to,

00:01:16.596 --> 00:01:18.762
so that people are proud to be a part of

00:01:18.762 --> 00:01:20.714
and you make it easy for them to share

00:01:20.714 --> 00:01:23.690
because they only have
to remember one word,

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.420
then referrals start to flow.

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:29.684
Make your message difficult,
boring and unremarkable

00:01:29.684 --> 00:01:31.690
and nobody will talk about you.

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.900
Make your message one word,
powerful and important,

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.226
and people will be delighted
to spread your message

00:01:37.226 --> 00:01:39.726
at every possible opportunity.

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.353
(swooshing)

